 {
  "name": "generate_podcast",
  "description": "生成双人对谈播客。输入四选一：\n- text：一篇文章，模型改写成对谈（推荐 12000 字以内，超出会截断）。\n- url：网页 / PDF / doc / txt 的公开链接，内容同 text。\n- topic：一个话题，模型联网搜索后生成；它只是话题，不能写格式要求。\n- dialogue：逐轮脚本直接演绎，如 [{\"speaker\":\"音色ID\",\"text\":\"本轮台词\"}]，每轮最多 300 字、总共 1 万字。\nspeakers：两个播客音色 ID（按给出的顺序），不传用官方默认。script_only=true 只生成脚本不合成音频（text/url 适用）。\nformat：mp3（默认）、pcm、aac、ogg_opus。parameters：官方请求里其余字段（如 retry_info 续传、input_info.input_text_max_length），深度合并。\ntransport默认sse（POST /api/v3/podcast/sse）；websocket仅用于历史接口兼容。\nSSE须收到152且code=20000000才成功；363或HTTP200不能视为成功。返回音频路径、完整rounds、usage、\ntask_id（首次150的真实session_id，续传仍用原ID）、session_id（本次会话）、last_finished_round_id；断线、轮次失败或服务端取消\n（151，canceled=true）时 files 里的 .partial 只含已完整结束的轮次，可用 parameters.retry_info 显式续传后按序拼接；\n未完成轮次的分片另存 diagnostic_file（字节数 discarded_bytes），仅供排查，不能作为续传输入。SSE的progress_file在150和完整362时保存原请求和可续传边界，MCP取消也保留。按官方播客计费，可能超过 300 秒；须同时提高客户端超时和MCP_TOOL_TIMEOUT_SEC。技巧见 get_speech_usage_examples(product='podcast')。\n",
  "inputSchema": {
   "properties": {
    "text": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Text"
    },
    "url": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Url"
    },
    "topic": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Topic"
    },
    "dialogue": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "items": {
        "additionalProperties": {
         "type": "string"
        },
        "type": "object"
       },
       "type": "array"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Dialogue"
    },
    "speakers": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "items": {
        "type": "string"
       },
       "type": "array"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Speakers"
    },
    "script_only": {
     "default": false,
     "title": "Script Only",
     "type": "boolean"
    },
    "format": {
     "default": "mp3",
     "title": "Format",
     "type": "string"
    },
    "out_dir": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "type": "string"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Out Dir"
    },
    "parameters": {
     "anyOf": [
      {
       "additionalProperties": true,
       "type": "object"
      },
      {
       "type": "null"
      }
     ],
     "default": null,
     "title": "Parameters"
    },
    "transport": {
     "default": "sse",
     "title": "Transport",
     "type": "string"
    }
   },
   "title": "generate_podcastArguments",
   "type": "object"
  },
  "outputSchema": {
   "type": "object",
   "required": [
    "ok"
   ],
   "properties": {
    "ok": {
     "type": "boolean"
    }
   },
   "additionalProperties": true
  },
  "annotations": {
   "readOnlyHint": false,
   "destructiveHint": false,
   "idempotentHint": false,
   "openWorldHint": true
  }
 },
 {
  "name": "get_job",
